title: "ClearScan Engineering: field notes from building and running a production ATS resume scanner"
abstract: "Engineering notes on building an ATS resume scanner: architecture, scoring philosophy, anti-gaming principles, AI that does not invent facts, occupational data, and real production incidents. Includes a set of 26 synthetic resumes with ground truth and a first benchmark of PDF text extractors."
